            "reference": "for OOF and test-development scenes separately, Wilson UCB95 is at most 0.10 for PSNR loss at least 0.10 dB, SSIM loss at least 0.005, and color-bias increase at least 1/255",
            "direction": "max",
            "threshold": 0.10,
            "uncertainty_id": "scene_level_familywise_uncertainty",
